uard alone costs it, so they wait for B2. A heavy against a rival who is guarding comes at the level's breakGuard, a held heavy at heldHeavy times earnerUse, and the signature at sigPick. anywhere.answer: the chance it guesses, when a rival's blow lands clean on it, that a launcher follows, and times its guard to it (interrupts.json brawl.launcher.anywhere.answer). Easy's is 0.25, from 0.2 (rulings-2026-10-26 items 43 and 44): the newcomer against easy read 97.0% at 0.2 with the pop dose, and 88.5% at 0.25 on 200 matches (Wilson 83.3 to 92.2, inside the 82 to 92 aimed at; docs/qa/rally-read-fa6f727a.md, fifth addendum)",
